  "text": "This is precisely what lead to my filing bankruptcy. Debt buying and selling, made a debt that was 10 years old, reappear on my credit report. Each time I mentioned that the debt was time-barred. I was informed that the debt had been bought, and that the \"clock\" had been restarted.",
